## Demo .gitignore zur Teilprüfung 1 von Dirk Reinarz
## Aufgrund mangelnder Kenntnisse über Webentwicklungsumgebungen werden nur beispielhafte Einträge aufgeführt

# Ignore log files
*.[Ll][Oo][Gg]

# Pacetmanager files
[Pp]acketmanager[Ii]nstallations/
*.packetmanagerfiletype

# File types to ignore
*.[Tt][Mm][Pp]
*.xyz
*.[Ss]ha

# File names to ignore
temp_*
*_tmp_*
*temporary.txt
[Dd]elete[Mm]e.*

# Ignore file name, but not folders with that names
src_*
!src_*/

# Folders to ignore (on all levels)
build/
temp/
keep/dismiss/

# Folders in specific folders to ignore
**/dis/miss/

# Folders to ignore on root levels
/ignore[Mm]e/
